another plant (= भद्र-बला); N. of one of Rā-
vaṇa's ministers (sent as ambassador to Rāma);
(अम्), n. a kind of perfume.

सरणि, इस्, f. a road, path, way [cf. 2. शरणि];
a straight or continuous line; the creeping plant
Pæderia Fetida; a disease of the throat.

